/* PlanetScale, Convex, and PostgreSQL from the Simple Icons set       */
/* v16.34.0 (https://simpleicons.org, CC0 1.0). Standalone copies with */
/* provenance comments live in public/brand/providers/; keep them in   */
/* sync if a mark is updated. Paths are inlined with fill forced to    */
/* currentColor, so every mark stays monochrome and matches the text   */
/* in both themes. Brand names remain trademarks of their owners; the  */
/* marks identify the brands in the compatibility table below.          */
/* The list is rendered twice for a seamless marquee; the duplicate    */
/* is aria-hidden. Under prefers-reduced-motion the marquee is static  */
